<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Dairy Brands, Apple Fields agree on placement.</title>
<headline>NZ Dairy Brands, Apple Fields agree on placement.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dairy Brands New Zealand Ltd said on Thursday it had agreed to a process with Apple Fields Ltd and other interests for the placement of their 52 percent stake in Dairy Brands.</p>
<p>&quot;Apple Fields has recently been reviewing its shareholding in Dairy Brands. The placement process reflects a desire by Apple Fields to exit their dairy investment to focus on other activities and by Dairy Brands to procure a long-term value adding investor,&quot; Dairy Brands said.</p>
<p>It said its board had engaged Southpac Corp Ltd to advise on and manage the placement process.  </p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
